From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rtibblesbot <richard+githubagent@learningequality.org>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 04:51:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] Make the page-turn buttons smaller

Kolibri's fork used these values, so the buttons cover less of the page.
---
 src/bloom-player-ui.less | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/bloom-player-ui.less b/src/bloom-player-ui.less
index 5aca86d..e36f1cf 100644
--- a/src/bloom-player-ui.less
+++ b/src/bloom-player-ui.less
@@ -108,8 +108,8 @@ We just make them follow the main content normally. */
     }
     .swiper-button-next,
     .swiper-button-prev {
-        height: 66%;
-        top: 17%; // height at 66% leaves 34% spacing, half of that is 17%
+        height: 25%;
+        top: 37.5%; // height at 25% leaves 75% spacing, half of that is 37.5%
         margin-top: unset; // defeat Swiper's own positioning that would throw ours off
         background-color: transparent; // except when hovering, see below.
         // This makes the grey buttons, which are all you can see when not hovering,
